"gpu: Reject empty rects in CopySharedImageHelper" (crbug 574376940; no CVE
listed yet): CopySharedImage() with an empty source rect drew nothing but
still marked the destination as cleared, exposing uninitialized GPU memory
to later readers. chromium/src main commit
295fab38e752ddea60f45ad85a48513657749749, merged on 2026-10-30 to 158 and to
157 as 0ce4835c3b4693e396ee743e28388b8285c6ed25 (refs/branch-heads/8103@{#1004},
after the 157.0.8103.33 tag); merges to 156 and LTS proposed. This is the
157 merge, without its tests. Drop it once a 157 tag has it.

